print("Text Quality (Prose)  : YES — khlm_write(topic, style)")
print("  ├─ essay    : Academic, evidence-based, 5 paragraphs")
print("  ├─ summary  : Bullet-point key facts structure")
print("  ├─ technical: Architecture/properties/benchmarks")
print("  ├─ story    : Narrative prose, no direct assertions")
